WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.770
Let s discuss the location of Link ART Centres in India.

2
00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:11.710
Link ART Centres bring H I V care closer to the community.

3
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:18.610
Options A and B are incorrect as they don t bring care to the community level.

4
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:25.460
The correct answer is sub, district hospitals and Community Health Centres.

5
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:32.690
Ensuring H I V patients are linked to care is crucial for viral suppression.

6
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.690
Use the mnemonic SUBSCRIBE to remember the location.

7
00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:43.600
Focus on the level of healthcare facility for Link ART Centres.

8
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:54.260
Refer to Park s Textbook, Chapter on H I V per AIDS, pages 547, 549.

9
00:00:54.260 --> 00:01:02.640
Link ART Centres provide free antiretroviral therapy at sub, district and community levels.
